      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>In 2016 after reading David Brin’s <tei:hi rend="italic">Earth</tei:hi> (1990), I wrote this blog post and later felt inspired to write this variant of El Malé for the vessels and probes that carry our dream of space science, and then also for the astronauts who died while pursuing that dream.</tei:p>
